Each entry below starts with a heading (Scheme_Name) followed by its field values, one "Field_Name: Value" line per field, in the same order as the original .txt file.

Pradhan Mantri Kisan Samman Nidhi PM-KISAN
Scheme_ID: GS01
Scheme_Name: Pradhan Mantri Kisan Samman Nidhi PM-KISAN
Government_Level: Central Government of India
Main_Purpose: Direct income support to farmer families
Target_Beneficiaries: Eligible landholding farmer families
Key_Benefit: Financial assistance of Rs 6000 per year paid in three equal instalments through Direct Benefit Transfer, scheme extended for 2026-27 to 2030-31, verify current instalment status on official portal
General_Eligibility: Landholding farmer families as per scheme guidelines, subject to exclusion criteria, verify current eligibility on official portal
Official_Source: Ministry of Agriculture and Farmers Welfare pmkisan.gov.in

Pradhan Mantri Fasal Bima Yojana PMFBY
Scheme_ID: GS02
Scheme_Name: Pradhan Mantri Fasal Bima Yojana PMFBY
Government_Level: Central Government of India
Main_Purpose: Crop insurance to protect farmers against crop loss
Target_Beneficiaries: Farmers growing notified crops in notified areas
Key_Benefit: Insurance coverage against yield loss due to natural calamities pests and diseases, exact premium and claim details verify with local agricultural expert or official portal
General_Eligibility: Farmers with insurable interest in notified crop in notified area, verify current eligibility on official portal
Official_Source: Ministry of Agriculture and Farmers Welfare pmfby.gov.in

Soil Health Card Scheme
Scheme_ID: GS03
Scheme_Name: Soil Health Card Scheme
Government_Level: Central Government of India
Main_Purpose: Provide farmers with soil nutrient status and fertilizer recommendations
Target_Beneficiaries: All farmers
Key_Benefit: Soil health card with crop wise fertilizer and nutrient recommendations, verify current details with local agriculture department
General_Eligibility: Farmers can apply through local agriculture department, verify current process on official portal
Official_Source: Department of Agriculture and Farmers Welfare soilhealth.dac.gov.in

Kisan Credit Card KCC Scheme
Scheme_ID: GS04
Scheme_Name: Kisan Credit Card KCC Scheme
Government_Level: Central Government of India
Main_Purpose: Provide farmers with timely access to short term credit
Target_Beneficiaries: Farmers including tenant farmers and self help group members as per guidelines
Key_Benefit: Short term credit at concessional interest rate for crop production and allied needs, exact terms verify with bank or local agricultural expert
General_Eligibility: Farmers meeting bank and scheme eligibility criteria, verify current process with local bank branch
Official_Source: Department of Agriculture and Farmers Welfare and RBI guidelines, verify at nearest bank branch

